st here you know  pence punted on some questions too but  at least the trump record  is there for everybody to see economic  prosperity peace deals in the middle  east holding china accountable  recovery even after the pandemic hit  but the biden campaign knows much of  what it has planned  isn't popular and they know they can't  deliver higher wages for most americans  so what they do and you saw her to do  this tonight is obfuscate  and prevaricate now when someone is  as left-wing as harris is you have to  ask  is she ever going to use her power for  the good of the middle class  how about the working class small  business owners  americans of faith the answer  never biden will not only make your life  miserable with lockdowns next year a  point that unfortunately mike pence did  not make tonight  but they'll also make you miserable by  leaving you  poorer less free and less safe  kamala harris true to her liberal san  francisco political roots  hates much about this country after all  she believes  like biden now that we're a systemically  racist nation that is a poisonous  awful terrible lie that mike pence  called out  this presumption that you hear  consistently  from joe biden and kamala harris that  that america is systemically racist and  that as joe biden said that he believes  that  law enforcement has an implicit bias  against minorities is  is a great insult to the men and women  who serve in law enforcement  it is remarkable that that when senator  tim scott tried to pass a police reform  bill  brought together a group of republicans  and democrats senator harris  you got up and walked out of the room we  don't have to choose between supporting  law enforcement  improving public safety and supporting  our african-american  neighbors all of our minorities by the  way she was smirking through most of  that answer  kamala harris threw down the race card  tonight and she lied  about what president trump said about  charlottesville of course susan page  didn't correct the record  and she did this all because she and joe  biden can't refute and certainly can't  beat the trump pence record on helping  african americans  joe biden though i think to a lot of  folks a lot of you who are watching  you're still up in the midwest and the  east coast maybe to you he represents  the democrat party of the past like a  safer  democrat party of 30 years ago it was a  little bit more moderate maybe for a lot  of you  you think about biden and you have kind  of a nostalgic  viewpoint but his talk of scranton  and his blue collar appeal it's all bunk  most of those folks  those blue-collar folks they're now for  trump and for good reason  the democrats are a party of wealthy  donors  and radical ivory tower types who want  to impose their extreme  anti-american agenda on the rest of us  that's who they are today  so all of the pain and suffering that  the liberal governors and mayors coveted  restrictions and lockdowns  have caused you that's not going to  bother democrats of today  whether on masks or travel limits the  rules  never apply to them or their  well-connected friends  they see kovid remember as a political  gift  which their old pal jane fonda admitted  today  i just think um covet is god's gift to  the left  it's really really funny well she did  speak the truth  when the other cable networks put the  chart up on the screen day in and day  out of covid deaths and  and infections they're not doing it  to empathize and inform you they're  doing it for one reason and one reason  only  as a political weapon against president  trump  kamala and pretty much everyone who  could end up in biden's cabinet  will be closer ideologically to  alexandria ocasio-cortez  than william jefferson clinton it's a  different party  now listen to how she spoke to the  parents of an american hostage who was  brutally murdered by  isis the inauthenticity  was palpable to the mueller family i i  know  about your daughter's case and i'm so  sorry  i'm so sorry what happened to her  is awful and it should have never  happened  get ready to hear that a lot if biden  wins  oh it's awful i'm so sorry that your job  was shipped to china  oh it's awful i'm so sorry that your  kids can't go to in-person classes  because we're locked down  or i'm sorry it's so awful that your  neighborhoods  aren't safe but we're not going to try  to offend anyone by enforcing the laws  i'm sorry you feel bad that mount  rushmore  has been demolished you're going to hear  that a lot  if biden harris wins the policies they  will enact  will be favorable to pro-china the  pro-china caucus on wall street  and in big business their policies will  be favorable to the global  scientific establishment pushing  lockdowns and climate change rules  they'll be supportive of leftist ideas  that come out of academia  and they'll be hostile to the middle  class and hostile to american history  and traditions  they'll be hostile to the oil and gas  industry hostile to practicing catholics  traditional christians and orthodox jews  this was another debate where the  moderator  was clearly in the tank for the  democrats most questions were worded  against trump  susan page interrupted pence for time  frequently and let harris drone on and  on when she got indignant  so pence did fine tonight he obviously  won and harris did  nothing to contradict what we already  know about her  none of her eye rolling or grimacing  or the insect moving on pence's head is  going to change  this simple fact the markets were up 500  points today  because trump's recovering and getting  stronger he's willing to do a targeted  stimulus  i do wish that pence said that the biden  obama economy in 2016 was so strong  so vibrant so great for the working  class  that americans decided to turn over the  country to donald trump  a guy with zero government experience

